description: MockDeviceKit for DAT development — simulating Meta glasses without physical hardware
globs: "**/*mock*.dart"
---

# DAT Mock Device

## Create and control
```dart
final uuid = await MetaWearablesDat.pairMockRayBanMeta();
await MetaWearablesDat.mockDevicePowerOn(uuid!);
await MetaWearablesDat.mockDeviceDon(uuid); // Required for streaming
```

## Mock camera feed
```dart
await MetaWearablesDat.setMockCameraFeed(uuid, videoPath); // H.265/HEVC only
await MetaWearablesDat.setMockCapturedImage(uuid, imagePath);
```

## Stream with mock device
Pass specific `deviceUUID` (not null): `startStreamSession(uuid, fps: 24)`

## Cleanup
```dart
await MetaWearablesDat.unpairMockRayBanMeta(uuid);
```

See `example/lib/providers/mock_device_provider.dart` for canonical pattern.
